[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CROSSBOW]
Ballista (Heavy Armor)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CROSSBOW_desc]
Firearms are intriguing, but hey, who needs a rapid-fire machine gun when you can have a weapon that takes five minutes to reload and requires the strength of a small army to draw the string?
§g“Not a good weapon to fight a battalion with, but a good weapon to fight a dragon with ...probably, if you can get it to stand still for five minutes.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CROSSBOW_short]
Ballista

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CROSSBOW]
弩机 (重甲装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CROSSBOW_desc]
火器确实很吸引人，但是当你能拥有一种需要五分钟才能装满子弹，还需要一支小部队的力量才能拉动弓弦的武器时，谁还需要速射机枪呢？
§g“它不是一种用来与别的军队作战的好武器，但它是一种与龙作战的好武器...也许吧，如果你能让龙听话地站在那里五分钟的话。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_CROSSBOW_short]
弩机
